From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Qualify the original loading call and its native SDK declarations
Upstream-base: dc238202b310059d80791d0140dee37f27b9a3bf
Classification: explicit temporary original-main diagnostic gate; permanent SDK/compiler ABI.

Part1 extends only the named MAIN_BOOTSTRAP diagnostic with the existing
DisplayLoadingMessageFast call at its original Initialize position after
glStartup. Normal main is token-identical; full tasks/reset remain omitted.
Part2 gives whole LidOpenMessage canonical native GX/VI/SC declarations,
including its actual32bit ARGB word and canonical enum types. Preserve the
original numeric NONE/ONE/ZERO/SET request through explicit native casts.
Console source, RLE bitmap, allocations, branches, passes and VI timing remain
unchanged. Hardware must execute real stores/copy/finish before acceptance.
CPU-written XFB coherence and full startup remain separate explicit holds.

diff --git a/src/Game/main.cpp b/src/Game/main.cpp
--- a/src/Game/main.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/main.cpp
@@ -506,7 +506,11 @@
         Bind<void>(MemFun<ResetTask, void>(&ResetTask::FSCheckForReset),
             &resetTask)));
 
+#endif // DVD/reset registration remains outside this selected loading gate
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MAIN_BOOTSTRAP) || defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MAIN_LOADING_MESSAGE)
     DisplayLoadingMessageFast();
+#endif
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MAIN_BOOTSTRAP)
     InitializeODEAllocators();
     RegisterUserGeomClasses();
 #endif // physics omitted; logical pads retain their source Initialize position
@@ -910,7 +914,11 @@
 #endif
 #else
     // Owner-authorized diagnostic checkpoint: full game startup has not run.
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MAIN_LOADING_MESSAGE)
+    return 86;
+#else
     return 81;
+#endif
 #endif
 #else
 
diff --git a/src/Game/FE/LidOpenMessage.cpp b/src/Game/FE/LidOpenMessage.cpp
--- a/src/Game/FE/LidOpenMessage.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/FE/LidOpenMessage.cpp
